spice
*MOSFET Differential Pair with Resistor Loads and Current Source
* Nodes: 1 (VDD), 2 (output/source), 3 (gate Q2), 4 (drain Q2), 5 (drain Q1), 6 (gate Q1), 7 (VOS), 8 (current source)

Q1 5 7 2 NMOS
Q2 4 3 2 NMOS

RD1 5 1 1k ; Resistor RD1
RD2 4 1 1k ; Resistor RD2

I1 8 2 DC 1mA ; Current source I

VDD 1 0 DC 5V ; Power supply voltage
VOS 7 0 DC 0V ; Differential input voltage zero

* Additional parameters for MOSFETs, like model or size may be added as needed